      "description": "`df -h` for `/`, `$HOME`, and every Steam library mountpoint — deduped by filesystem. Reporting every library matters on multi-drive setups (e.g. an SD-card SteamLibrary) where the stacked-usage bar would otherwise show a \"used\" total that exceeds the displayed disk capacity.",
